\begin_layout Section*
In summary
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Complexity is still the enemy.
 However,
 we have tools that don’t only help us to manage it,
 but also subtly change how we see state,
 local and global variables,
 and where errors fit in.
 I’ve tried to build some of this into 
\series bold
\emph on
Zyzyxia
\series default
\emph default
.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
This is as much a cultural change as it is about the programming language,
 but sometimes language can influence how we think,
 and then how we behave.
\end_layout

